#. Translators: Name of an NVDA command in the Input Gestures dialog; opens a list to pick freeAudio's main audio output device.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\audioDeviceMixin.py:30
msgid "Select the main freeAudio output device"
msgstr "Выберите основное устройство вывода freeAudio"

#. Translators: Title of the warning about the old FreeRadio add-on still being installed.
#. Translators: Title of this settings category as it appears in NVDA's own Settings dialog category tree.
#: addon\globalPlugins\freeAudio\audioDeviceMixin.py:31
